k:8, Def:3)</span>.<br/>Classification: 1 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 30.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This weapon/tool is used to cut <a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">wheat</a> found in wheat fields. Needed to access <a href=\"#/quest/the-secret-library-quest\">The Secret Library</a>, you'll need to use a <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Scythe</strong> on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Monument\">monument</a> located to the right of the altar found <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32177,31927,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32177, 31927, 7)</a>.\n</p><p>You can use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Squeezing%20Gear%20of%20Girlpower\">Squeezing Gear of Girlpower</a> as a substitution for this tool.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-object-proficiency\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Weapon_Proficiency\">Weapon Proficiency</span></h3>\n<div class=\"weapon_proficiency weapon_proficiency_border\">\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_number_table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Defence\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+1 defence</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_ic